# Pure-fact data (non-negotiable)

Show the **official main draw as it exists**. A seat is a fact if the official draw or Tennis API published it. Fiction is names, slots, byes, or times nobody published.

Tennis API is the source for player identities, results, and timed schedule. Official draw structure (size, slot order, seeds, byes, WC/PR, Qualifier/LL) is also fact. If the API has no slot map, still show the official seats — do not hide them or invent a 64-draw from match ids.

## Allowed (must show)

- Tournament rows with a real `provider_tournament_id` (calendar metadata is ok before a draw exists)
- Named seats: `provider_player_id` + real last name
- Byes the official draw published: `is_bye = true`, `provider_player_id` null
- Official TBD seats (Qualifier / Lucky Loser): keep the TBD label, no invented name
- WC / PR / seed / country when the official draw or provider proved them
- Match results / schedule whose `winner_ref` / `match_key` map to those seats
- `lock_at` from the earliest **timed** main-draw first ball (`has_time = true`). Date-only fixtures are not a kickoff.
- Pre-draw public pages: name, dates, tour, surface, countdown — **no empty or invented bracket**

## Forbidden

- Fictional seats (`Player47`, `p-0`…`p-15`, `Player ${id}`)
- Inventing a qualifier name, a bye the official draw did not publish, or a guessed slot order
- Hiding a named match, an official bye, or an official TBD seat behind “draw pending”
- Padding extra seats so a partial field looks like 32/64/96
- Hard-coding tournament URLs/refs instead of reading `tournaments.ref`
- Odds, predictions, or any non-fact product data
- A midnight / `15:00` lock the provider did not prove

## Incomplete official draw

Fail **closed** on fiction. Fail **open** on official seats.

If the main draw is out (including 96-player / 128-slot Masters with seed byes and Q/LL TBD), publish those seats in official order. Do not wait for every qualifier to be named. Do not collapse it to a 64-draw of named pairs only.

If there is no official main draw yet, keep the event **draw pending**. Do not wipe a verified draw to fill a gap with fiction. Do not ship a showcase/fixture draw on the live calendar.

```sql
-- Public draw: every seat is named OR official bye OR official TBD.
-- No fictional last names. Slot count = official draw size (32/64/128).
```
